## TrendsApi

### Returns editorial articles for a given region
## Returns editorial articles for a given region
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/trends/editorial_articles?region={{region}}
Accept: application/json

### Get featured topics
## Get featured topics
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/trends/topics/featured?interest={{interest}}&region={{region}}
Accept: application/json

### Get product category details
## Get product category details
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/trends/product_categories/details?productCategories={{productCategories}}&region={{region}}&lookbackWindow={{lookbackWindow}}&engagementType={{engagementType}}
Accept: application/json

### Get a list of growing Shopping Product Categories
## Get a list of growing Shopping Product Categories
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/trends/product_categories/trending?region={{region}}&verticals={{verticals}}&ages={{ages}}&genders={{genders}}&engagementType={{engagementType}}
Accept: application/json
